// V2.0: the first equipment catalogue. Every name is original. Damage of a
// weapon is its `modifiers.attack` (ATK) times its class power
// (weapon_classes.ron); `weapon` adds element and reach; `visual` changes the
// look (Trail: strike colour and weapon accent, Cape: cape layer, Tint: body
// colour grade; on a shield, V2.2, the shield colour).
// Docs: docs/EQUIPMENT_EXPANSION_V2_0.md §13.
(
    items: [
        // ---- Swords (the Iron Sword is in starter_gear.ron) -------------
        (
            id: "duskwater_saber",
            name: "Duskwater Saber",
            description: "A curved blade quenched in a cold well. Its edge frosts the air.",
            category: Sword,
            rarity: "uncommon",
            modifiers: (attack: 11),
            weapon: Some((element: Ice, reach_bonus: 4.0)),
            visual: Some(Trail(color: (0.55, 0.85, 1.0))),
            weight: 3.0,
            sell_value: 160,
        ),
        // ---- Daggers ----------------------------------------------------
        (
            id: "gutter_knife",
            name: "Gutter Knife",
            description: "Short, quick and forgettable. Lucky hands favour it.",
